            <td class="px dm-card" style="padding:40px 40px 32px; background-color:#ffffff; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
              <h1 class="h1-m dm-text" style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:30px; line-height:38px; color:#111827; font-weight:bold;">Welcome aboard, %%FirstName%%</h1>
              <p class="dm-muted" style="margin:0 0 28px; font-size:16px; line-height:26px; color:#4b5563;">Your Northwind account is ready. Here are three quick steps to get the most out of it in your first week.</p>
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" bgcolor="#4f46e5" style="border-radius:6px;">
