            <td class="px dm-card dm-text" style="padding:0 40px 32px; background-color:#ffffff; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:26px; color:#374151;">
              <h2 class="dm-text" style="margin:0 0 12px; font-size:20px; line-height:28px; color:#111827;">Get started</h2>
              <p style="margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>1. Complete your profile.</strong> Add your team and timezone so reminders arrive at the right time.</p>
