                      <img src="https://placehold.co/260x150/ccfbf1/0f766e/png?text=Case%20study" width="260" alt="Case study article" class="fluid" style="display:block; width:100%; max-width:260px; height:auto; border-radius:6px; margin:0 0 14px;">
                      <h3 class="dm-text" style="margin:0 0 8px; font-size:18px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">Case study: Fernhill</h3>
